/-!
# three_qubit_ghz_spurious_minimum_arithmetic_certificate

Topic: quantum   Node: aee133689f78

Provenance: helper lemma.

For the displayed rational GHZ-coordinate vector and nine signed-permutation Pauli generators, the exact probability-deviation cost exceeds 1/25000, each gradient component has magnitude less than 10^-14, and the integer Hessian formula has a strictly diagonally dominant positive congruence after subtracting the equivalent of I/10000. This is the arithmetic part of a proposed local-minimum counterexample, not the local-minimum theorem itself.
-/

